<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">

<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <title>System Error: The application cannot be found!</title>
    <style type="text/css">
        .style1
        {
            color: #CC0000;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: large;
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .style2
        {
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: medium;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body background="404_back.png" bgcolor="#000000">

    <p class="style1">
        System Error 404: The application cannot be found!</p>
    <p class="style2">
        Please make sure that you clicked on the right link or typed the correct web 
        address.<br />
        If you did those things then the application might not exist!</p>

</body>
</html>
